body:
The instagram ads put me off. Now I know, I should have given this app a try sooner. 

This app is thoughtful and adorable. My favourite features on this app are the “buddy up your goals” feature, the “send good vibes” feature, and the entire process of utilizing self-care areas with goal creation &gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;

If I could change ONE thing about this app I would make navigation less confusing. The embedded layers at some points seems unnecessary - could just be me.
